  "title": "Halloween Finger Cookies",
  "description": "Halloween finger food doesn't get more literal than these frightful finger-shaped cookies packed with pecans and topped with bloody almond 'nails.'",
  "authors": [
    "Renee"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-07-19T00:51:26-04:00",
